@1 = ~Black Dragon Pooling Breath~
@2 = ~Black Dragon Pooling Breath
(Conjuration)

Level: 3
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 7.5-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Breath half

The Black Dragon Disciple breathes on the ground and creates a pool of acid. Every round, each creature in the pool, ally or enemy, suffers 2d6 points of acid damage; a successful save vs. Breath halves the damage. The caster is not harmed by his own pool, but he is stunned for 2 seconds after breathing.~
